WEBVTT

00:07.300 --> 00:09.400
I'm so hung over...

00:09.400 --> 00:11.140
Miss Raeliana.

00:11.790 --> 00:13.370
Venia...

00:13.920 --> 00:17.120
I'd really like to sleep 
a little longer today...

00:17.120 --> 00:20.130
There is someone here to see you, my lady.

00:20.130 --> 00:22.060
To see me?

00:22.060 --> 00:25.340
Tell them I'm not feeling well 
and send them home.

00:25.340 --> 00:28.210
But it's His Grace the Duke...

00:29.590 --> 00:31.200
What did you say?

00:35.050 --> 00:36.520
A deal? {ep1 final}

00:36.520 --> 00:39.020
It's about the royal seal. {/ep1}

00:41.500 --> 00:43.960
Neither the master 
nor the mistress are at home.

00:43.960 --> 00:45.440
What shall I do?

00:46.440 --> 00:47.980
All right.

00:47.980 --> 00:49.760
Have him wait in the living room.

00:54.360 --> 00:56.080
<i>I just have to come out and tell him</i>

00:56.530 --> 00:59.180
<i>that if he doesn't want me 
to expose the dirt on him,</i>

00:59.180 --> 01:02.100
<i>he has to help me break off my engagement.</i>

02:41.760 --> 02:44.780
Welcome, Duke.

02:45.360 --> 02:47.110
Miss McMillan...

02:47.110 --> 02:51.020
I'm glad to see you made 
it home safely last night.

02:51.020 --> 02:54.030
Yes, thanks to you, sir.

02:54.340 --> 02:57.780
Are you feeling unwell? You look pale.

02:57.780 --> 03:01.600
No, I was just a bit surprised.

03:01.600 --> 03:03.300
<i>I feel like puking...</i>

03:03.760 --> 03:09.080
But I never dreamed I'd see 
you again so soon. I am honored.

03:09.570 --> 03:12.200
<i>He doesn't even look like 
the same man today.</i>

03:12.580 --> 03:15.840
I fervently wished to see you
 as soon as possible.

03:16.370 --> 03:19.190
Please pardon my imposition.

03:19.190 --> 03:20.760
Sir...

03:22.020 --> 03:24.760
Isn't His Grace the Duke the one 
that even Vivian Shamal

03:24.770 --> 03:28.350
couldn't seduce, no matter 
how hard she tried?

03:28.850 --> 03:31.410
And yet he's here, and with a bouquet, no less!

03:35.110 --> 03:37.860
Nothing's better for 
a hangover than ice cream!

03:37.860 --> 03:42.740
Why did you drink so much, anyway? 
You know you can't hold your liquor.

03:42.740 --> 03:44.060
It had been so long...

03:44.060 --> 03:46.650
I thought I could get away 
with just a little bit.

03:47.120 --> 03:51.640
<i>I can't tell her I don't know this 
body's limits because it isn't my own.</i>

03:52.060 --> 03:56.380
So... why did His Grace the Duke come here?

03:56.380 --> 03:58.750
You're curious about that, too?

03:58.750 --> 04:00.060
Of course I am!

04:00.480 --> 04:03.400
I can't talk about it in a lot of detail...

04:03.400 --> 04:06.670
But I happened to meet him 
at the banquet yesterday,

04:06.670 --> 04:09.650
and we realized that we had 
certain things in common.

04:09.650 --> 04:10.900
Oh, my!

04:11.210 --> 04:15.400
I think he could prove to be 
a great partner if things work out.

04:15.400 --> 04:20.520
Wow! My lady with His Grace the Duke?!

04:17.790 --> 04:20.520
<i>I mean a </i>business<i> partner, of course...</i>

04:26.140 --> 04:27.640
Okay, so...

04:29.070 --> 04:30.720
For starters...

04:31.160 --> 04:34.230
I guess I should learn 
how to write a contract.

04:31.160 --> 04:34.790
<b>Even a Monkey Can Understand
 How to Write a Contract 
so You Won't Be Deceived</b>

04:35.680 --> 04:38.790
I hear the Duke came to see you.

04:41.170 --> 04:43.560
Would you mind explaining 
what that's all about?

04:44.780 --> 04:48.640
We... I mean, I...

04:49.410 --> 04:52.800
want to break off my 
engagement to Lord Brooks.

04:55.640 --> 05:00.880
Raeli, did you not love Lord Brooks dearly?

05:00.880 --> 05:02.590
I didn't, Father.

05:03.600 --> 05:06.700
I was only abiding by the decision 
made by both of our families,

05:06.700 --> 05:09.450
for the benefit of the McMillan family.

05:09.900 --> 05:11.330
But now...

05:11.330 --> 05:15.250
I want to spend my life 
with someone I truly love.

05:18.880 --> 05:23.620
<i>That said, this affects both 
the McMillan family and my father's business.</i>

05:23.620 --> 05:27.390
<i>I don't expect him to just 
calmly tell me he understands.</i>

05:29.600 --> 05:30.920
I understand.

05:30.920 --> 05:31.840
Huh?

05:32.750 --> 05:35.020
Um... Father?

05:35.020 --> 05:41.100
You have always done as we said, 
without a single word of complaint.

05:41.420 --> 05:44.040
We were proud to have such a daughter,

05:44.040 --> 05:47.180
but it also made us worry about you.

05:47.180 --> 05:50.740
We questioned whether 
or not you were truly happy.

05:50.740 --> 05:51.800
Yes.

05:51.800 --> 05:56.410
You don't need to endure 
anything for our sakes.

05:56.960 --> 06:02.620
Our beloved daughter's 
happiness is our happiness.

06:04.240 --> 06:07.060
<i>I was so disgusted with myself, 
I thought my heart might burst.</i>

06:07.620 --> 06:08.770
Okay...

06:09.320 --> 06:11.980
<i>I'm not even...</i>

06:12.990 --> 06:14.890
<i>your real daughter.</i>

06:15.870 --> 06:20.970
<i>I swallowed the words down so hard, 
they stuck like thorns in my chest.</i>

06:39.220 --> 06:42.860
It is an honor to welcome you,
 Miss McMillan.

06:43.420 --> 06:46.650
The master awaits you inside.

06:59.620 --> 07:02.040
Duke, I hope the day finds you well.

07:02.040 --> 07:04.200
Let's skip the tiresome greetings, shall we?

07:16.020 --> 07:18.290
You spoke of the royal seal.

07:18.290 --> 07:19.450
Yes,

07:19.450 --> 07:23.050
it seems the royal seal that 
disappeared still has not been found.

07:23.320 --> 07:28.420
If you wonder why I spoke of this 
to you, of all people...

07:28.880 --> 07:32.260
I believe you yourself know 
the reason better than anyone.

07:33.690 --> 07:38.500
I'm sure no one hates me, 
the one who knows where the seal is,

07:38.500 --> 07:40.440
as much as you do.

07:41.460 --> 07:43.220
What makes you think so?

07:44.100 --> 07:47.480
Because you are the one 
in possession of the royal seal.

07:51.240 --> 07:55.940
<i>He serves as a guide to lead 
the old nobility against the new nobility.</i>

07:55.940 --> 07:59.350
<i>No one would expect him 
to have the royal seal</i>

07:59.350 --> 08:02.630
<i>that the royal family uses to enact laws.</i>

08:03.370 --> 08:06.470
<i>But that's exactly what 
the royal family wants.</i>

08:06.880 --> 08:10.720
<i>Noah's role in leading 
the old nobility is just for show.</i>

08:10.720 --> 08:12.890
<i>He's actually the king's pawn.</i>

08:13.610 --> 08:15.400
<i>The only ones who know the truth</i>

08:15.400 --> 08:17.520
<i>are the duke's household 
and those closest to the royal family...</i>

08:17.520 --> 08:21.250
<i>and me, one who came 
to this world from outside.</i>

08:21.680 --> 08:26.630
<i>Though it's actually supposed to be 
the novel's heroine who knows it, not me.</i>

08:29.720 --> 08:32.470
Are you being serious?

08:33.360 --> 08:36.100
And here I decided 
to have this discussion with you.

08:36.100 --> 08:37.290
Now it's no fun.

08:37.540 --> 08:38.850
<i>What did he say?!</i>

08:41.830 --> 08:43.820
We've wasted precious time.

08:43.820 --> 08:45.790
Let's pretend this never happened.

08:47.540 --> 08:49.300
<i>I can't lose my composure.</i>

08:49.300 --> 08:52.080
<i>He's testing me right now.</i>

08:52.880 --> 08:58.180
I believe your family graveyard is 
located at 31 Vangelio Street.

08:58.180 --> 09:01.570
The grave of your cousin, 
Robert Wynknight...

09:02.360 --> 09:04.310
is where it's buried, correct?

09:04.560 --> 09:07.110
Saying any more will do you no good.

09:07.110 --> 09:08.360
Please leave now.

09:10.440 --> 09:13.800
<i>After all I've said, 
he's still feigning ignorance?</i>

09:14.180 --> 09:15.390
<i>In that case...</i>

09:17.200 --> 09:18.620
Very well.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.890
I will take my leave, then.

09:27.680 --> 09:30.990
<i>He definitely reacted 
when I brought up the royal seal.</i>

09:31.000 --> 09:34.910
<i>Which means everything 
I said must have been right.</i>

09:35.730 --> 09:37.740
<i>So I can't lose heart.</i>

09:37.740 --> 09:39.300
<i>I have to appear confident.</i>

09:40.760 --> 09:42.470
<i>That said...</i>

09:43.300 --> 09:46.100
<i>I don't have that many cards to play.</i>

09:46.540 --> 09:50.930
<i>If he decides to say everything I told 
him was made up, it's all over.</i>

09:52.500 --> 09:54.200
<i>So please...</i>

09:55.090 --> 09:56.870
<i>Stop me from leaving!</i>

09:58.430 --> 10:00.700
<i>Is this really the end of it?</i>

10:02.340 --> 10:04.050
<i>There must be some way...</i>

10:09.700 --> 10:12.590
<i>A chess board with only one king on it.</i>

10:12.870 --> 10:15.190
<i>The number of pieces don't add up...</i>

10:15.880 --> 10:16.950
<i>Is this...</i>

10:17.860 --> 10:20.110
<i>the current state of the Kingdom of Chamus?!</i>

10:23.340 --> 10:24.850
Sir...

10:27.690 --> 10:30.670
Please move that bishop to the right.

10:32.200 --> 10:35.180
That would place the Gale family under you.

10:35.970 --> 10:38.410
Because the next head of the Gale family...

10:38.990 --> 10:43.110
is not the eldest son, Valdur, 
but the second, Harrelson.

10:43.990 --> 10:49.100
Valdur is backing and financially supporting 
a militia that the kingdom is wary of.

10:49.550 --> 10:52.540
I'm sure you're aware 
that this is no mere rumor.

10:53.700 --> 10:57.340
To the Gale family, 
he is essentially a ticking time bomb.

10:57.350 --> 11:01.610
That means they have no choice 
but to select the second son, Harrelson.

11:03.060 --> 11:06.300
Don't they? We have no way to be certain.

11:06.600 --> 11:08.590
The truth will be known in time.

11:09.130 --> 11:10.440
Well, then...

11:10.710 --> 11:11.560
Wait.

11:14.050 --> 11:15.440
Very well.

11:17.110 --> 11:18.990
Let's negotiate.

11:30.050 --> 11:33.020
<i>Was this really a good idea?</i>

11:33.020 --> 11:35.670
<i>I feel like I'm getting myself mixed up with</i>

11:35.680 --> 11:38.800
<i>someone even more dangerous 
than Francis Brooks.</i>

11:39.550 --> 11:40.800
In other words...

11:41.010 --> 11:43.580
You want me to pretend to be your fiancé?

11:43.580 --> 11:46.760
Yes. That is my only condition.

11:46.760 --> 11:47.630
Why?

11:47.630 --> 11:49.300
Is a reason necessary?

11:49.300 --> 11:50.820
Depending on the situation.

11:50.820 --> 11:52.260
And in the current situation?

11:52.260 --> 11:53.370
It's necessary.

11:53.970 --> 11:56.340
Uh... right.

11:56.820 --> 12:00.920
<i>Then again, I came from a different world,</i>

12:00.920 --> 12:04.450
<i>and I've read about what 
happens in this world.</i>

12:05.700 --> 12:08.490
<i>That's how I know where the royal seal is.</i>

12:08.490 --> 12:10.570
<i>But it's not as if I can tell him that.</i>

12:11.400 --> 12:15.930
I heard a rumor that Lord Brooks 
was trying to kill me.

12:16.740 --> 12:22.470
So I want justification for ending my 
engagement to him as quickly as possible.

12:22.470 --> 12:26.420
You would take such a rumor 
seriously even with no evidence?

12:26.420 --> 12:29.500
It doesn't matter if you don't believe me.

12:29.500 --> 12:34.370
Did this rumor come from the same place 
as your knowledge of the royal seal?

12:34.740 --> 12:37.980
Well... yes, that's right.

12:37.980 --> 12:41.110
Why don't you tell me what 
this source of yours is?

12:41.110 --> 12:46.200
I would like you to agree to a contract 
without requiring me to tell you.

12:46.200 --> 12:47.840
I can't do that.

12:47.840 --> 12:50.820
The source of my information 
has already died.

12:50.820 --> 12:52.950
I cannot reveal their identity.

12:54.360 --> 12:58.270
If you cannot agree to that, 
we will forget all talk of this contract.

12:59.130 --> 13:02.640
The information I possess 
is extremely valuable.

13:02.650 --> 13:06.180
There are many who would 
pay any price to obtain it.

13:07.140 --> 13:09.300
I'm sure some would happily lick my boots

13:09.300 --> 13:12.770
if it meant they would have 
a chance to bring you down.

13:14.400 --> 13:16.730
<i>What's so funny?</i>

13:18.610 --> 13:24.160
Did you not come to me because you 
fear those people wouldn't believe you?

13:25.160 --> 13:27.660
Can we just stop these negotiations now?

13:28.160 --> 13:29.590
Six months.

13:29.590 --> 13:32.970
If you'll pretend to be my fiancé 
for just six months,

13:32.970 --> 13:38.300
you will likely never see me again 
after that period is over.

13:39.320 --> 13:40.570
Never again.

13:41.790 --> 13:44.800
<i>So just hurry up and sign this already!</i>

13:47.420 --> 13:48.400
All right.

13:52.070 --> 13:55.310
<i>The deal is made? Seriously?</i>

13:58.620 --> 13:59.940
In return...

14:00.170 --> 14:02.440
For as long as this farce goes on,

14:02.440 --> 14:07.710
you will play your part as my 
fiancée whenever I need you to.

14:08.520 --> 14:10.990
What do you mean by that?

14:13.850 --> 14:15.010
Oh...

14:16.540 --> 14:18.860
You'll see soon enough, 
whether you want to or not.

14:21.680 --> 14:23.280
<i>Then, some days later...</i>

14:24.000 --> 14:28.680
<i>I would wish to death that I had never 
made a contract with this man.</i>

14:30.480 --> 14:33.660
<i>From one disaster to the next...</i>

14:34.540 --> 14:39.180
<i>"Immense compensation demanded in return 
for one-sided engagement annulment."</i>

14:39.660 --> 14:44.180
<i>I never thought a family as high-ranking 
as the Brooks would go this far.</i>

14:45.030 --> 14:47.600
<i>Besides, if this could 
be resolved with money,</i>

14:47.600 --> 14:50.880
<i>I wouldn't have needed 
to go through all this.</i>

14:51.780 --> 14:54.010
<i>Nothing I can do about it now, though.</i>

14:54.660 --> 14:59.100
<i>The one bound to cause 
the most trouble for me now is...</i>

15:00.290 --> 15:03.860
<i>Yep, this guy. Adam Taylor.</i>

15:03.860 --> 15:06.180
<i>The knight Noah assigned specifically to me.</i>

15:06.630 --> 15:08.870
<i>He's also known as the Observer.</i>

15:13.500 --> 15:16.170
<i>Jeez, his gaze stings!</i>

15:17.180 --> 15:20.680
<i>He had a pretty strong 
presence in the novel, too.</i>

15:21.120 --> 15:24.160
<i>He stood on the battlefield 
from a young age as a child soldier.</i>

15:24.160 --> 15:27.200
<i>He's an exceptional fighter 
who's been through many battles.</i>

15:28.900 --> 15:33.320
<i>But then the royal family halted 
the use of child soldiers,</i>

15:33.740 --> 15:35.870
<i>so Adam had nowhere to go.</i>

15:36.960 --> 15:40.720
<i>He was then hired by the Wynknight
 family to serve as a knight,</i>

15:40.720 --> 15:43.150
<i>at which point he swore loyalty to Noah.</i>

15:44.210 --> 15:47.900
<i>The maids gushed that Noah's assignment 
of Adam, someone so close to him,</i>

15:47.900 --> 15:50.320
<i>must be out of love for me,</i>

15:50.320 --> 15:51.470
<i>but in truth,</i>

15:51.470 --> 15:56.920
<i>it's no more than a warning that 
if I do anything funny, I'll lose my head.</i>

15:57.800 --> 16:00.520
<i>But that's all well and good.</i>

16:00.520 --> 16:01.980
<i>The problem is...</i>

16:03.240 --> 16:04.500
Master Taylor.

16:06.450 --> 16:12.290
Will you serve as my guard even when 
I move to the duke's mansion?

16:15.780 --> 16:18.530
<i>Say something, would you?!</i>

16:20.940 --> 16:23.660
<i>Yes... In three days,</i>

16:23.660 --> 16:25.790
<i>I have to go to the duke's mansion.</i>

16:27.280 --> 16:31.880
I'll need you to move 
to my mansion as soon as possible.

16:32.420 --> 16:33.960
Why is that?

16:33.960 --> 16:38.060
Because you will be a candidate 
for marriage into the House of Wynknight.

16:38.440 --> 16:41.910
Y-Yes, but we're still only engaged.

16:41.910 --> 16:43.680
That's exactly why it's necessary.

16:44.480 --> 16:46.240
Call it bridal training, perhaps?

16:51.790 --> 16:53.090
My lady.

16:56.570 --> 16:57.680
What is it?

16:57.680 --> 17:00.870
My lady, this must be so difficult for you.

17:00.870 --> 17:01.560
Huh?

17:01.560 --> 17:05.570
I can't fathom why the master 
and mistress don't say anything!

17:05.570 --> 17:10.480
<i>Everyone else just says I couldn't 
have found a better man to marry.</i>

17:10.480 --> 17:13.290
<i>Elma's the only one who understands me.</i>

17:13.290 --> 17:14.850
Those red eyes...

17:14.850 --> 17:15.590
Huh?

17:15.720 --> 17:18.760
He looks like he might swing 
that sword at any moment.

17:18.760 --> 17:20.340
Oh, you meant Master Taylor?

17:20.340 --> 17:21.560
Yes.

17:21.560 --> 17:24.840
I hear some people call him 
the God of Death.

17:25.780 --> 17:30.180
Plus, they say he descends from 
that band of savages, the Alsasa.

17:30.180 --> 17:32.240
Why would he hire someone like that?

17:32.240 --> 17:36.840
Elma, Master Taylor is a hero 
of this kingdom and a fine knight.

17:36.840 --> 17:38.090
My lady?

17:38.090 --> 17:43.230
That's why the Duke assigned him to guard me.

17:43.230 --> 17:44.240
But...

17:44.240 --> 17:46.500
Please refrain from saying such rude things.

17:48.510 --> 17:50.910
I'm very sorry.

17:50.910 --> 17:54.880
I was just concerned about you.

17:54.880 --> 17:57.050
Yes, I know.

17:57.050 --> 18:02.820
I just don't want you to judge people 
based on their looks and backgrounds.

18:02.820 --> 18:03.840
Right...

18:04.290 --> 18:06.530
So you wanted to talk to me?

18:06.760 --> 18:08.800
Oh... Yes.

18:08.800 --> 18:12.770
I finished making the chocolate-covered 
almonds that you asked for.

18:12.770 --> 18:14.770
Wow, really?!

18:15.050 --> 18:16.900
Thank you!

18:16.900 --> 18:18.670
That must have been a lot of work!

18:18.670 --> 18:19.610
Not at all.

18:30.740 --> 18:33.600
Are you knowledgeable 
about flowers, Master Taylor?

18:36.560 --> 18:39.840
Um... What foods do you like?

18:42.080 --> 18:43.990
<i>He's too silent!</i>

18:44.400 --> 18:45.840
Sister!

18:46.430 --> 18:48.130
Sister!

18:48.130 --> 18:49.440
Rose!

18:50.360 --> 18:52.140
Rosemary!

18:52.680 --> 18:54.930
My angel!

18:55.550 --> 18:57.450
What have you been doing?

18:57.450 --> 18:58.400
Praying!

18:58.400 --> 18:59.680
Praying?

18:59.680 --> 19:04.440
That you and the Duke will be 
happy forever and ever!

19:05.320 --> 19:07.700
<i>Rosemary!</i>

19:07.700 --> 19:09.900
Oh, I just can't stand it!

19:09.900 --> 19:11.820
I'm getting dizzy!

19:13.560 --> 19:15.350
What's the balloon for?

19:16.070 --> 19:17.090
Oh, this?

19:17.790 --> 19:21.000
To let go into the sky, like this.

19:30.480 --> 19:31.930
What do we do?

19:32.340 --> 19:35.110
Let's have Hans get it when he comes later.

19:35.110 --> 19:37.600
I'm sure a gardener would have a stepladder.

19:38.560 --> 19:41.200
It has to go up into the sky.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.110
Why?

19:42.110 --> 19:46.900
The balloon is going to 
carry my wish up to the gods.

19:46.900 --> 19:52.130
My wish for you and the Duke 
to be happy forever and ever.

19:53.660 --> 19:56.370
What if it takes too long 
to carry it to the gods,

19:56.370 --> 20:00.620
and the balloon forgets my wish?

20:01.550 --> 20:03.360
<i>She's just too cute!</i>

20:03.360 --> 20:04.890
Sister?

20:05.170 --> 20:08.810
Sorry. You're so cute, I just can't...

20:09.570 --> 20:11.660
Don't worry about the balloon.

20:11.660 --> 20:13.920
I'm sure it'll remember your wish.

20:13.920 --> 20:14.890
Really?

20:14.890 --> 20:15.790
Yes.

20:15.790 --> 20:20.640
So eat these with me while we 
wait for Hans to get here.

20:22.060 --> 20:23.130
Okay.

20:32.460 --> 20:34.650
The balloon flew away!

20:36.080 --> 20:37.440
I didn't expect that...

20:41.560 --> 20:45.170
<i>I figured he'd think a thing like this 
was none of his concern.</i>

20:46.080 --> 20:48.260
Thank you, Master Taylor.

20:48.260 --> 20:51.070
Go on, Rosemary. You should thank him.

20:54.870 --> 20:56.430
Give me your hand.

21:01.360 --> 21:03.700
Thank you very much!

21:05.350 --> 21:06.780
<i>Huh?</i>

21:06.780 --> 21:10.880
<i>He seemed like he reacted more 
quickly than usual to that.</i>

21:11.850 --> 21:16.160
Could it be that you like sweets?

21:19.420 --> 21:23.300
<i>Aw, there's a cute side to him!</i>

21:31.410 --> 21:34.100
<i>Since he had to be on 
the battlefield since childhood,</i>

21:34.100 --> 21:37.800
<i>he probably never had a chance 
to act much like a child.</i>

21:38.520 --> 21:39.850
Once again...

21:40.260 --> 21:42.630
I look forward to your continued service.

21:46.540 --> 21:51.050
<i>I should get Elma to make more of those 
before I move to the duke's mansion.</i>

21:53.880 --> 21:55.120
<i>And then...</i>

21:55.810 --> 21:57.970
<i>The morning of that day arrived.</i>

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Episode Three</b>

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Why Raeliana Trained in Domestic Arts</b>
